{"title":"Slow Work","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Wenna Dray teaches ice as a way of making things wait. She starts students on snakes, because cold already makes a snake slow.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/wenna-dray\">Wenna Dray</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"wenna-dray\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring in the steps recorded so far.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/wenna-dray\">Wenna Dray</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Orc Lair)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"wenna-dray\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 6 coral snakes by their burrows east of Wenna Dray&#39;s post <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Go back to Wenna Dray on the west road <span class=\"muted\">at -160, 97</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-160|97|Go back to Wenna Dray on the west road\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>75</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/scroll-ice-zap\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/89f9dc0356926f71c73f.svg\" alt=\"\">Scroll Ice Zap</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Wenna Dray says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Wenna Dray:</b> Six fewer for the carters to step around.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Wenna Dray:</b> Ice Zap. It wants 20 Intellect before it will open for you. If you&#39;re short, spend your next focus points on Intellect.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"Six fewer for the carters to step around.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Slow Work</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Wenna Dray says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mage-ice-slow-work\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}